    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>ALTERNATIVE 1 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Δ U = \\frac{3}{2} R n Δ T = \\frac{3}{2} P Δ V\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q = \\frac{3}{2} P Δ V + P Δ V = \\frac{5}{2} P Δ V\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q=\\frac{5}{2}\\times 22\\times 10^{3}\\times 3.2-4.5\\times 10^{-2}=-7.15\\times 10^{2}≈-700 J\"></span> ✓   ALTERNATIVE 2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q = \\frac{3}{2} R n Δ T + P Δ V = \\frac{3}{2} \\frac{P V}{T} Δ T + P Δ V\"></span> ✓ temperature at C: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{560\\times 3.2}{4.5}=398 K\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Q=\\frac{3}{2}\\times \\frac{1000}{560}\\times 398-560+22\\times 10^{3}\\times 3.2-4.5\\times 10^{-2}=-7.15\\times 10^{2} J\"></span> ✓ <br/>Do not penalize absence of minus sign Allow use of n = 0.21 mol</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{Q}_{i n} =  Δ U + W = 0 + 480 =  840 \\, J\"></span> ✓ <br/>ALTERNATIVE 1 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"η=\\frac{W}{Q_{in}}=\\frac{Q_{in}-Q_{out}}{Q_{in}}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"η=\\frac{840-715}{840}=0.149≈0.15\"></span> ✓   ALTERNATIVE 2 Net work done (125 ± 20) J by counting squares in loop ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"η=\\frac{125}{840}=0.15±0.02\"></span> ✓<br/>Allow η = 0.17 if rounded 700 J is used Award [3] for a CNA</p></section>"
